<title>UK: American Express unit sets $125 mln FRN.</title>
<headline>American Express unit sets $125 mln FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Goldman Sachs International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   AMERICAN EXPRESS TRAVEL RELATED SERVICES CO INC</p>
<p> AMT    $125 MLN	SPREAD     10 BP     MATURITY  *    OCT.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 BASE	 3M LIBOR  PAY DATE    24.OCT.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY AA3	 ISS PRICE  99.825    FULL FEES   15 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   A+	  REOFFER    99.825</p>
<p> NOTES    * CALL AT PAR FROM OCTOBER 1999</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  U.S.	TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    5 BP	SELL CONC  10 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
